---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Preview preparing a fresh draft from a held original, or confirm it

Usage: mxr recovery prepare-draft [OPTIONS] --expected-revision <EXPECTED_REVISION> --expected-workspace <JSON> <DRAFT_ID>

Arguments:
  <DRAFT_ID>

Options:
      --expected-revision <EXPECTED_REVISION>

      --expected-workspace <JSON>
          Owner JSON returned by `mxr recovery status` or the preview
      --confirm

      --format <FORMAT>
          [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help
          Print help
